cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MorphoTrace: a browser-based polygon annotation tool for projected-area ground truth"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Browser-based tool to outline organisms in images as polygons (with holes) and export their exact
  projected areas in px² and mm², binary masks and per-image CSV, as manual reference measurements for
  plankton biometry and other scientific imaging. Runs offline; images are never uploaded.
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dvdsosa/morphotrace"
url: "https://dvdsosa.github.io/morphotrace/"
authors:
  - family-names: Sosa-Trejo
    given-names: David
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6337-8698"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Las Palmas de Gran Canaria (IOCAG) / University of Málaga"
keywords: [image annotation, polygon, segmentation ground truth, biometry, plankton]
